\chapter{Related Works}\label{sec:relatedworks}

\textbf{2.1 Chatbots Developed to Provide Support}

Various chatbot systems have been designed with the intention of offering psychological or emotional support to users in need. These systems typically aim to deliver conversational care, emotional monitoring, or cognitive behavioral interventions. This subsection highlights several such systems, describing their core purposes, distinctive features, and the contexts in which they have been applied or studied. The table below summarizes key examples.

