    \section{Conversation Flow}

The Socius chatbot follows a structured, API-driven conversation flow grounded in the APAM framework. The process has been expanded into four primary functional phases: Session Initiation, Active Conversation (AI Partner Phase), Closing \& Analysis, and Follow-up Interaction (AI Mentor Phase). Each phase coordinates specific API endpoints, backend state management, and database operations.

