\SetCell[r=4]{l} \textbf{1. Session \\ Initiation}
& 1 & User selects a specific conversational scenario in the Frontend UI. \\
& 2 & Frontend triggers \texttt{/api/start-session} sending the \texttt{scenario\_id}. \\
& 3 & Flask creates a \texttt{SociusChatbot} instance and loads constraints from \texttt{scenarios.json}. \\
& 4 & AI Partner generates a contextual opening line, returning the \texttt{session\_id} to the UI. \\

\SetCell[r=4]{l} \textbf{2. Active \\ Conversation}
& 5 & User inputs and sends a message through the Frontend chat interface. \\
& 6 & Frontend calls \texttt{/api/stream-message} for the active \texttt{session\_id}. \\
& 7 & AI Partner generates a response based on history and Gricean system instructions. \\
& 8 & Response streams to UI via Server-Sent Events (SSE); history is saved in the session state. \\

\SetCell[r=5]{l} \textbf{3. Closing \& \\ Analysis}
