\SetCell[r=4]{l} \textbf{4. Follow-up \\ Interaction}
& 14 & User asks follow-up questions regarding performance or scores (``Ask Mentor Why''). \\
& 15 & Frontend calls \texttt{/api/stream-mentor} with the user's specific query. \\
