During the Active Conversation phase, the system utilizes real-time streaming to minimize perceived latency. Once the interaction is concluded, the Closing \& Analysis phase executes a highly rigid prompt that forces the AI Mentor to output machine-parsable float scores and text justifications. This data is subsequently used to populate the user's longitudinal Progress Dashboard.

